+    // engine#315 diagnostic: probe the same region with a second d2h, then compare it with the real copy.
+    //   probe NONFINITE            -> the device data was already non-finite at copy time (producer/arena)
+    //   probe hash != copy hash    -> the region changed between the two reads (reuse/race under us)
+    //   probe == copy, both FINITE -> this download is clean
